      47.98,
      479.74,
      543.8,
      553.21
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by subsections (1) and (4) of section 2 of the Fauna and Flora Protection Ordinance (Chapter 469), I, Pavithra Vanniarachchi, Minister of Wildlife and Forest Resources Conservation, do by this Order declare that the area of land described in the Schedule hereto shall, with effect from the date of publication of this Order, cease to be a part of the \u201cWedithalathive Nature Reserve\u201d described in the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1956/13 of March 01, 2016 and that the remaining area of land after exclusion of the area described in the Schedule hereto shall be called and known as the \u201cWedithalathive Nature Reserve\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
